The preparation item of the end-of-module quiz comes first in that quiz,
before the knowledge items.
Its three choices are ordered from no preparation to thorough, so the
choices are not shuffled (the settings above disable shuffling globally);
Canvas requires a \enquote{correct} answer even for an ungraded item, so
the [[scoring_data]] value below is arbitrary and never shown, since the
result view hides correctness.
The same holds for the choice items that follow.

