    "scoring_data": {"value": 1},
    "scoring_algorithm": "Equivalence"
  }
}
@

Errors are normal (\cref{sec:errors}): the recompile loop is the working
mode, not a failure mode.
The distractors treat a compilation error as terminal---the document lost
or corrupted---rather than as something to read and fix.

